  "Combat.SuccubusGardener.SapSpeed.CuppingHerBreasts": "Cupping her breasts under the cover of her tentacular minions, the gardening succubus coos, [say: Slow down a little and enjoy the sights, why don't you?] She squeezes, and arcs of glittering milk (or is that sap?) erupt from her elongated nipples, spraying out in continuous streams towards your [feet]. You try to evade at the last second, but the streams follow you every which way, eventually coating you in a layer amber milk-sap."
