  "Combat.SuccubusGardener.TasteTheEcstasy.ItHangsThere": "[pg]It hangs there for a moment while the succubus yanks your mouth open, just in time to receive the undoubtedly drugged jism. It practically sizzles on your tongue, tasting of almonds and walnuts with a distinctly fruity aftertaste. Your mouth gulps it down automatically, and with slow-dawning comprehension, you understand how the succubus could be so obsessed with these plants. Your groin heats eagerly as the plant spunk absorbs into your system. Your pupils dilate. Gods, it feels good!"
  "Combat.SuccubusGardener.TasteTheEcstasy.OneOfThose": "[pg]One of those tentacles is above you now, and it points down, its phallic shape clear. The slit at the end spreads open, and a blob of whitish goo appears. "
  "Combat.SuccubusGardener.TasteTheEcstasy.ShePouts": "[pg]She pouts. [say: Come on, just a taste!]"
  "Combat.SuccubusGardener.TasteTheEcstasy.ThatSAll": "[pg]That's all the warning you need to redouble your efforts. Riding high on a surge of adrenaline, you tear your way out of the temptress' bonds before she can feed you any more corruption."
  "Combat.SuccubusGardener.TasteTheEcstasy.ThreeTentaclesStab": "Three tentacles stab out at you like organic spears, but you easily evade them... directly into the succubus's arms! Too late, you realize that the offensive was a feint! Her tremendous tits are pressing into your back, and you feel a trickle of wetness leaking down your [leg] as she grinds against you. At the same time, she whispers into your ear, [say: Just have a taste... sample the ecstasy. You'll see that indulging is the best thing you could possibly do.]"
  "Combat.SuccubusGardener.TasteTheEcstasy.YouBarelyEven": "[pg]You barely even realize that the temptress has stepped away. How can you fight this?"
  "Combat.SuccubusGardener.Taunt.TheGreenThumbed": "[say: How do you expect to defeat me, [name],] the green-thumbed temptress asks with a quirk of her head. [say: You are but one, and we are many. You have the frailties and weaknesses of a soul. I have power and experience beyond your comprehension. What is there for you to do but willingly submit?] She purses her puffy lips, thinking. [say: If you submit willingly, I'll allow you to lay your head between my breasts while my plants feed on you. It'll be quite the experience.]"
  "Combat.SuccubusGardener.Tentagrapple.AWebOf": "A web of interwoven vines lashes out from behind the succubus, somehow leaving her untouched by the wave of advancing greenery. They're trying to grab you!"
  "Combat.SuccubusGardener.Tentagrapple.YouSlipAside": " You slip aside at the last moment, barely avoiding being wrapped in the squirming mass. It snaps back, perhaps at the limits of its reach, leaving you once more eye to eye with the alluring gardener."
  "Combat.SuccubusGardener.Tentagrapple.YouTwistTo": " You twist to the side, but one snags you by the wrist. Another loops around your [leg], and an avalanche of slime-oozing tentacles falls across the rest of you, wrapping you up in snug coils. Their grip is equal parts iron grip and lover's caress. You'd better struggle free before they really start to work on you!"
  "Combat.SuccubusGardener.VineHeal.ActingOnSome": "Acting on some unseen signal, the forest of tentacles lurches into action, surrounding its insensate mistress in a veil of wiggling green. A bundle of slime-dripping vines can be spotted through gaps in the verdant veil, hanging over their demonic caretaker with remarkable care, leaking gooey strands of pink into her mouth. Her throat works to swallow it, and when she emerges a second later, her injuries have vanished and her eyes"
  "Combat.SuccubusGardener.VineHeal.AreDilatedAnd": " are dilated and a little slow."
